      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of being decommissioned is a perfect description of how exhausting it is to keep performing when the script is done. You've given so much of yourself to the world, and now you're left with the quiet, which can feel like a failure. Maybe the next chapter isn't about grand contributions, but about finally allowing yourself to be the object of your own attention, even if that means letting go of the need to \"contribute\" at all.",
      "source": "target",
